OL,3,GNEWSAFirms fined over #1m after workman
OL,4,A'buried alive'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo businesses have been fined more
OL,7,Fthan #1m over the "horrifying" death of
OL,8,Fa labourer who was buried alive.
OL,10,FGheorghita Arsene, 33, was crushed when
OL,11,Fa deep trench collapsed and covered him
OL,12,Fin soil while working on a construction
OL,13,Fsite in Banstead, Surrey, in June 2020.
OL,15,FAppledorn Developments and T Vaughan
OL,16,FLimited (TVL) were found guilty of a
OL,17,Fcharge under the Health and Safety at
OL,18,FWork Act 1974 following a three-month
OL,19,Ftrial at the Old Bailey.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
